        "Design a table for something you track (books, tasks, expenses) with 3-5 named columns and SQLite types. Create it in :memory:, insert 3 rows with named-column INSERTs, read them back ordered, and assert the column list via LIMIT 0 description. Show the full green transcript plus one sentence stating what the contract guarantees readers.",
